                        "sense_id": "aa67c822-d1e7-31f1-97e3-50f57a2a7668",
                        "entry_id": "21963643-8491-322d-8a26-389b3b046d16",
                        "glosses": [
                            "w sposób ładny, miły, przyjemny, dobry"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "9937c367-8ce0-4d4c-8eb7-575c37245e31",
                                "sense_id": "aa67c822-d1e7-31f1-97e3-50f57a2a7668",
                                "text": "Ładnie ci w tych kolczykach."
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1.1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "42ba9a44-044e-4329-90d9-0187fb32876c",
                        "source_entry_id": "21963643-8491-322d-8a26-389b3b046d16",
                        "source_sense_id": "aa67c822-d1e7-31f1-97e3-50f57a2a7668",
                        "target_lang_word": "nicely",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "nicely",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c725bb73-a647-31c6-a632-3b8c7f8e80b5",
                                        "entry_id": "dcf87a45-ba16-3e5d-a12f-31f1cb27e6a3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Fastidiously; carefully."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "obsolete"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "118ab2ae-c44d-4324-bca5-d56c20a1e271",
                                                "sense_id": "c725bb73-a647-31c6-a632-3b8c7f8e80b5",
                                                "text": "He lookt askew with his mistrustfull eyes, / And nicely trode, as thornes lay in his way, / Or that the flore to shrinke he did auyse [...]."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8f77559a-f86c-3821-b2c7-ac9a0d17302c",
                                        "entry_id": "dcf87a45-ba16-3e5d-a12f-31f1cb27e6a3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Precisely; with fine discernment or judgement."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "de7a8b63-fa1f-4f28-9c41-26a51a259aba",
                                                "sense_id": "8f77559a-f86c-3821-b2c7-ac9a0d17302c",
                                                "text": "All told, we had scarce two miles to run; but the navigation was delicate, the entrance to this northern anchorage was not only narrow and shoal, but lay east and west, so that the schooner must be nicely handled to be got in."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b5f1a56e-bbc9-4ed3-bf66-c226b9905389",
                                                "sense_id": "8f77559a-f86c-3821-b2c7-ac9a0d17302c",
                                                "text": "An army – especially in peace time – is a very complex and nicely adjusted affair […]."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3ddff41e-e319-41b1-9b55-38d86f332f03",
                                                "sense_id": "8f77559a-f86c-3821-b2c7-ac9a0d17302c",
                                                "text": "Henry's carefully calibrated public appearances would present him as the wellspring of honour, justice and power, the unknowable, all-seeing sovereign who, as the Milanese ambassador Soncino nicely observed, appeared in public ‘like one at the top of a tower looking on at what is passing in the plain’."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4dc27262-758c-3286-8b32-c49bf7960468",
                                        "entry_id": "dcf87a45-ba16-3e5d-a12f-31f1cb27e6a3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pleasantly; satisfactorily."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "47e344ec-c512-45cf-9e14-5956279e4cb8",
                                                "sense_id": "4dc27262-758c-3286-8b32-c49bf7960468",
                                                "text": "1986-1987, Lou Sullivan, personal diary, quoted in 2019, Ellis Martin, Zach Ozma (editors), We Both Laughed In Pleasure\nHe was a sweet boy, but became the kind of man I can do nicely without."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f5178663-08d3-493e-aea9-6be53c15a57f",
                        "source_entry_id": "21963643-8491-322d-8a26-389b3b046d16",
                        "source_sense_id": "aa67c822-d1e7-31f1-97e3-50f57a2a7668",
                        "target_lang_word": "prettily",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "prettily",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b5010ce5-beba-3300-8d35-9dc71a78a436",
                                        "entry_id": "b7b9c60e-a192-30ba-bc80-90de43642cd1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "In a pretty manner."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0a28e4d5-0e85-4df1-9e20-a886c8738ee5",
                                                "sense_id": "b5010ce5-beba-3300-8d35-9dc71a78a436",
                                                "text": "And thus they were all begging for pancakes, the one more prettily than the other, because they were so hungry, and such good little children."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c5fc51ee-2077-4a9d-a9fb-b6ce217ae9e4",
                                                "sense_id": "b5010ce5-beba-3300-8d35-9dc71a78a436",
                                                "text": "St. Lawrence Station is very prettily situated, high cliffs on the left, and the lush vegetation of the Undercliff sloping down to the sea on the right."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f270896f-4da8-4433-8a46-f9bdd29b5bd6",
                                                "sense_id": "b5010ce5-beba-3300-8d35-9dc71a78a436",
                                                "text": "The air was clear and scented, the breeze flitted lightly through the tall grass around his cave, the birds were chirruping at each other, the butterflies were flitting about prettily, and the whole of nature seemed to be conspiring to be as pleasant as it possibly could."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b0100251-9871-37d2-a1c9-6407774446b8",
                                        "entry_id": "b7b9c60e-a192-30ba-bc80-90de43642cd1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Very badly; terribly."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5b314fbe-d9c7-4482-acdc-d6b804ce7556",
                                                "sense_id": "b0100251-9871-37d2-a1c9-6407774446b8",
                                                "text": "“Indeed!” replied he. “Then, my dear Isabella, it is the most extraordinary sort of thing in the world, for in general every thing does give you cold. Walk home!—you are prettily shod for walking home, I dare say. It will be bad enough for the horses.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5a110d5b-012d-4c5d-820c-e25739b2ab87",
                        "source_entry_id": "21963643-8491-322d-8a26-389b3b046d16",
                        "source_sense_id": "aa67c822-d1e7-31f1-97e3-50f57a2a7668",
                        "target_lang_word": "hezky",
                        "target_lang_code": "cs",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "hezky",
                                "target_lang_code": "cs",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2cf2f1eb-81e4-32fe-b5d0-09771919ed08",
                                        "entry_id": "42e3d5c3-e420-3760-9b65-d9a0f5d74ba5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "esteticky příjemným způsobem"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f01f29f8-9fba-44c5-9ace-993bfa358ed2",
                                                "sense_id": "2cf2f1eb-81e4-32fe-b5d0-09771919ed08",
                                                "text": "Měj se hezky."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3968ce0e-267d-46d4-b981-bff695c444c4",
                                                "sense_id": "2cf2f1eb-81e4-32fe-b5d0-09771919ed08",
                                                "text": "Ta poslední škodovka vypadá opravdu moc hezky."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "37b2b4fc-5e7c-38b2-b370-b87fe20f7872",
                                        "entry_id": "42e3d5c3-e420-3760-9b65-d9a0f5d74ba5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "vyjadřuje míru, hodně, mnoho"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ec42dc71-d727-4192-b492-7fda83155cac",
                                                "sense_id": "37b2b4fc-5e7c-38b2-b370-b87fe20f7872",
                                                "text": "Tak to jsem se zase jednou hezky vyspala."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2e92f16c-76f5-326b-8e28-53204b2cb876",
                                        "entry_id": "42e3d5c3-e420-3760-9b65-d9a0f5d74ba5",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "citově zbarvuje výpověď"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f4ec3b6e-6587-4899-80ec-870d973b7013",
                                                "sense_id": "2e92f16c-76f5-326b-8e28-53204b2cb876",
                                                "text": "Neodmlouvej, hezky se oblíkni a půjdeme."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "363c2355-6ea2-4de6-bf29-ec8091df52a8",
                                                "sense_id": "2e92f16c-76f5-326b-8e28-53204b2cb876",
                                                "text": "Hezky se uč a potom možná půjdeme do té zoo."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "316fef98-2f56-4b71-ab05-13c484806b22",
                        "source_entry_id": "21963643-8491-322d-8a26-389b3b046d16",
                        "source_sense_id": "aa67c822-d1e7-31f1-97e3-50f57a2a7668",
                        "target_lang_word": "приятно",
                        "target_lang_code": "ru",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "приятно",
                                "target_lang_code": "ru",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9797b248-7c3b-3f78-837b-e6d21c206925",
                                        "entry_id": "3d2b04e9-3634-3583-b28c-1ad27ccfd555",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "наречие к приятный; доставляя удовольствие, вызывая положительные эмоции"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "adverb"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9ceda976-32e7-425d-915e-580a230d8d2a",
                                                "sense_id": "9797b248-7c3b-3f78-837b-e6d21c206925",
                                                "text": "И в оранжерее тоже приятно пахнет ― да жить в ней нельзя."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "78c4cd85-091d-4d87-8d2b-c3b004f85193",
                                                "sense_id": "9797b248-7c3b-3f78-837b-e6d21c206925",
                                                "text": "Как человек, император был приятно удивлён."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5f2f3ac5-7cca-4575-853f-c11af572b6b1",
                                                "sense_id": "9797b248-7c3b-3f78-837b-e6d21c206925",
                                                "text": "Босые ноги приятно холодила влажная земля, а оголенные полные икры и шею ищущими горячими губами целовал суховей."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8afa47ed-f49b-3884-a024-29526fd95ee6",
                                        "entry_id": "3d2b04e9-3634-3583-b28c-1ad27ccfd555",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "предик. о чувстве удовольствия, испытываемом кем-либо"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "25c5f8cd-e0b4-4d11-af1f-4deb39400720",
                                                "sense_id": "8afa47ed-f49b-3884-a024-29526fd95ee6",
                                                "text": "Очень приятно, что довелось познакомиться с таким выдающимся человеком."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b976a212-9fcc-4d74-a605-e9051c9eeeca",
                                                "sense_id": "8afa47ed-f49b-3884-a024-29526fd95ee6",
                                                "text": "Приятно бродить по зимнему лесу, вдыхать чистый, свежий, морозный воздух."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
